# Deploy the springblades BEFORE the fighting starts, then strike.
#
# This is the control half of bd inc-tek.8.8, finding PA-08-F14. The free
# off-guard strike must still work when the blades are snapped out at the
# opening of an engagement -- that is what the item is for, and it is what
# stops a "fix" that merely deleted the effect from passing.
#
# THE ORACLE is the item's own line, "Springblade effect!"
# (lib/m_items.irh, Item "springblade", PRE(EV_HIT)). Nothing else prints it.
#
# EIGHT ACTIVATION ATTEMPTS, not one. The fix puts a Handle Device check (DC
# 15) on deployment, and a rogue fails it more often than not. A jammed attempt
# costs a round and changes nothing else, so the run simply tries again; the
# attempts after the first success say "You're already loaded!" and are inert.
# tools/check_springblade.sh requires that one of the eight said the blades
# snapped out, and calls the run inconclusive otherwise.

@include springblade-setup.keys

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
RIGHT ENTER
@dump:0001-goblin-summoned

a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0002-deploy-1
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0003-deploy-2
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0004-deploy-3
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0005-deploy-4
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0006-deploy-5
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0007-deploy-6
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0008-deploy-7
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0009-deploy-8

RIGHT
@while "Confirm attack" y
@dump:0010-strike

@quit
